== Effects ==
* {{r|Shop}}s can be opened without using {{E|Key}}s.

== Notes ==
* Cannot appear in [[Greed Mode]].
* {{c|Keeper}} starts with this trinket after he defeats {{e|Satan}}.
* {{dlc|r}} This trinket is useless for {{c|Tainted Keeper}}, as all shops are always open for him.

== Synergies ==
* {{A|Golden Trinket|r+}} / {{i|Mom's Box|r+}}: Shops cannot be their lowest quality variants. If Isaac has both a golden trinket and the Box, shop quality is improved in general.

== Interactions ==
* {{i|Pay To Play}}: Overrides Store Key. Shops still require a coin to enter.

